# Platform Settings & D3 Topology — Cursor IDE Conventions

## Single source of truth

All UI parameters live in **`mock-client/config/platform.settings.json`**.

Independent D3 page: **`http://localhost:8080/topology-d3/`** (no RequireJS/jQuery).

Legacy full GUI: **`http://localhost:8080/target/`** (unchanged).

## Naming convention matrix

| Layer | Convention | Example |
|-------|------------|---------|
| JSON root keys | camelCase | `platformMeta`, `sessionContext` |
| JSON nested IDs | camelCase | `layerId`, `deviceId`, `menuItemId` |
| Legacy DOM `id` | snake_case | `#topology-container`, `#operator_list` |
| D3 SVG `id` | legacy parity | `SECTGRP_overall-status`, `APOI_001_led` |
| D3 CSS classes | kebab-case | `topology-d3-node`, `layer_header` |
| JS modules | camelCase files | `topologyD3Renderer.js` |
| JS functions | camelCase | `renderTopologyD3`, `computeLayerSeverity` |
| JS constants | SCREAMING_SNAKE | `PLATFORM_SETTINGS_URL` |
| Axsh backend fields | preserve casing | `"Node Type"`, `Comm`, `Status`, `SysName` |

## platform.settings.json sections

| Key | Purpose |
|-----|---------|
| `platformMeta` | vendor, model, viewport baseline |
| `designTokens` | pixel-perfect layout/colors (from header.css + msdh/code.js) |
| `sessionContext` | username, versions, model, site tag |
| `headerBar` | COBHAM/idDAS header labels + asset paths |
| `systemOverviewBar` | routing profile, operator, display mode, user |
| `navigationMenu` | common + target menu tree (from header.html + msdh/header.html) |
| `severityModel` | Comm/Status → LED gradient mapping |
| `topologyD3.layers[]` | screenshot-accurate layer/device tree for D3 |
| `mockApiBindings` | optional doc map cmd → settings path |

## topologyD3.layers[] device fields

```json
{
  "deviceId": "MTDI_001",
  "deviceTag": "MTDI-1",
  "nodeType": "MTDI",
  "commCode": "0",
  "statusCode": "0",
  "locationTag": "Rack-1",
  "nodeOrder": 1,
  "severity": 0
}
```

- `commCode`: `0`=connected, `1`=fail, `-`=unknown
- `statusCode`: `0`=alarm … `4`=ok
- `severity`: optional override; else computed by `computeDeviceSeverity()`

## Menu diagnosis (from screenshot + msdh/header.html)

**Tagline (`navigationMenu.menuTagline`):** "The GUI covers full device lifecycle management:"

**Toolbar parameters (systemOverviewBar):**
- `routingProfileValue` → "oper1"
- `operatorSelectedValue` → dropdown
- `displayModeSelectedValue` → `topology` | `rack`
- `loggedInUserValue` → "sysadmin"

**Target menu sections:** Wizards, RF, Devices, System Administration  
**Common menu sections:** Alarms, Others

